{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 8 från SD.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 8 by SD.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Gender equality", "dok_titel": "Research", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2022/23:82 by Samuel Gonzalez Westling et al. (V) motion 4,\n\n2022/23:348 by Rickard Nordin (C) motion 2,\n\n2022/23:884 by Muharrem Demirok et al. (C) motion 78,\n\n2022/23:1026 by Patrick Reslow et al. (SD) motions 6 and 7,\n\n2022/23:1673 by Annie Lööf et al. (C) motion 12, and\n\n2022/23:2277 by Märta Stenevi et al. (MP) motion 11.", "notis": "The Riksdag has dealt with approximately 80 proposals about research in motions from the general motion period of 2022. The Riksdag rejected all proposals, partly because work is ongoing or because measures have already been taken.\nThe proposals dealt with, for example, the distribution of research funding, research freedom and scientific quality.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2022/23:82 by Samuel Gonzalez Westling et al. (V) motion 4,\n\n2022/23:348 by Rickard Nordin (C) motion 2,\n\n2022/23:884 by Muharrem Demirok et al. (C) motion 78,\n\n2022/23:1026 by Patrick Reslow et al. (SD) motions 6 and 7,\n\n2022/23:1673 by Annie Lööf et al. (C) motion 12, and\n\n2022/23:2277 by Märta Stenevi et al. (MP) motion 11.", "Reservation 8"]}, "votering_id": "DAA6BF7F-D5D3-496E-97F8-6B1189D92507", "rm": "2022/23", "beteckning": "UbU11", "punkt": 6, "dok_id": "HA01UbU11", "datum": "2023-06-14", "utskott": "UbU", "rubrik": "Jämställdhet", "dok_titel": "Forskning", "sammanfattning": "Utbildningsu